     "body": "<p>Solution discussed for <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3971\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3971</a> should also apply for this tickt.</p>\n\n<p>See <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3971?focusedCommentId=28716\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">FCREPO-3971, comment 28716</a>.</p>",
